{'symbol': 'ETSY', 'date': '2021-07-06 08:00:00', 'title': 'ETSY COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF ELO7, BRAZIL-BASED MARKETPLACE FOR UNIQUE, HANDMADE ITEMS', 'text': 'BROOKLYN, N.Y., JULY 6, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ETSY, INC. (NASDAQ: ETSY), WHICH OPERATES TWO-SIDED ONLINE MARKETPLACES THAT CONNECT MILLIONS OF PASSIONATE AND CREATIVE BUYERS AND SELLERS AROUND THE WORLD, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPLETION OF ITS PREVIOUSLY-ANNOUNCED ACQUISITION OF ELO7.'}